00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.010
And I tried to get at that.

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:54.891
A version of that question that way by asking,
say about, say, belief in God, does it believe

00:09:54.891 --> 00:09:57.850
in God correlate with people's regrets?

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:00.440
D. Zero correlation of any kind.

