I asked people, Do you gave people three choices?

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:04.670
Do you believe in God?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.440
Which of these best describes your belief?

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:07.710
I believe in God.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:08.710
I don't believe in God.

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:09.710
I'm not sure.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:15.450
I believe in God and zero correlation of any
kind, with me, with anything.

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:20.330
I also asked people whether they believed
that in general, everything in life happened

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.150
for a reason.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:24.510
And most people did it.

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:26.670
Most people also believe they have free will.

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:34.420
So, so, so other ways at that question about
belief systems seem to indicate there.

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:35.680
There wasn't much difference.

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:36.680
I mean, I'm not.

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:38.220
I'm hesitant to say that.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:40.700
I'm very hesitant to say definitively.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:47.380
My hunch right now is that that that that
belief systems didn't matter all that much.

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:55.070
And it could be because regret is so central
to our literally to our brain function.

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:57.910
That is, our brains don't have a nationality.

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:02.530
Our behavior can have a nationality because
as our brains acting in a context.

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:10.960
But ah, but the the lump of of of cells in
our head doesn't isn't, you know, an Indonesian

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:16.400
isn't an Indonesian brain or an American brain
or a Polish brain, it's just a brain.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:17.400
Yeah, right is central.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.400
Speaker 1: That makes sense.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:22.589
I mean, at the same time, there are so many
cultural ideas and memes like, you know, FOMO

00:11:22.589 --> 00:11:24.400
fear of missing out YOLO.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:27.649
You only live ones that aren't the same across
