degrees especially had more career regrets
than other people.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:20.970
Which is weird because.

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:22.460
You know that.

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:26.870
But but it's so superficially weird, but it
goes to exactly to your point, which is that

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:32.350
the fact that they had more career opportunities
