00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:40.110
That said, thwarted opportunity can also be
a source of regret.

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:45.910
So opportunity sort of lives at the core of
regret, but in a somewhat paradoxical way.

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:51.050
Huge numbers of opportunities can lead to
